{"data":{"videos":[{"id":"cmt78p9r70pfli9e05vd0w8z5","bgmId":572768,"categoryId":null,"name":"一念永恒（分季版） 完结季","slug":"video-38627","sub":"一念永恒（分季版） 第四季","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/fa/da/572768_iX280.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":null,"actor":null,"writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"为苍生大义，白小纯不得不与通天道人展开决战。随着旧世界破碎，众人流落天外的永恒大陆。而在这里白小纯将面对更严峻的挑战，更强大的敌人……","remarks":"更新至第7集","tag":"动画","area":"中国","lang":"国语","year":2026,"season":null,"total":11,"episodeCount":7,"serial":true,"status":1,"score":0,"scoreCount":0,"hits":23,"hitsDay":2,"hitsWeek":23,"hitsMonth":23,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-24T12:56:17.059Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T07:01:02.820Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":1,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmt70alnr0p3pi9e0uzsow2c5","bgmId":420069,"categoryId":null,"name":"炼气十万年","slug":"video-32000","sub":"煉氣十萬年","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/01/18/420069_J4NmR.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":null,"actor":null,"writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"十万年前，天岚宗叱咤修真界，宗内弟子皆是天骄，所向披靡。唯独开山弟子徐阳一直是炼气期，为突破修为早日飞升，徐阳闭关万年。谁知出关时，修真界已经没落，天岚宗也只剩三五弟子，眼见就要灭宗，徐阳击退强敌，誓要带领天岚宗重回巅峰！ 随着天岚宗势力扩大，徐阳修为停滞的真相也一步步的揭开，万年间，一个贯穿人、魔、仙三界的隐秘也展现在众人面前！究竟是一念成神，还是一念成魔？世界的生死就在徐阳的股掌之间！","remarks":"更新至第363集","tag":"动画,动作冒险,奇幻","area":"中国","lang":"国语","year":2023,"season":null,"total":420,"episodeCount":363,"serial":true,"status":1,"score":9,"scoreCount":0,"hits":47,"hitsDay":21,"hitsWeek":47,"hitsMonth":47,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-24T09:00:55.719Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T07:00:57.675Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":1,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmt70a4aw0p2pi9e09664m520","bgmId":345768,"categoryId":null,"name":"遮天","slug":"video-32139","sub":"遮天 第一季 缘起","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/3f/59/345768_SNN2b.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":null,"actor":null,"writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"本作动画改编自起点白金作者辰东遮天三部曲的第一部——遮天。冰冷与黑暗并存的宇宙深处，九具庞大的龙尸拉着一口青铜古棺，亘古长存。这是太空探测器在枯寂的宇宙中捕捉到的一幅极其震撼的画面。九龙拉棺，究竟是回到了上古，还是来到了星空的彼岸？一个浩大的仙侠世界，光怪陆离，神秘无尽。热血似火山沸腾，激情若瀚海汹涌，欲望如深渊无止境……登天路，踏歌行，弹指遮天。","remarks":"更新至第176集","tag":"动画,动作冒险,剧情,奇幻","area":"中国","lang":"国语","year":2023,"season":null,"total":190,"episodeCount":176,"serial":true,"status":1,"score":9,"scoreCount":0,"hits":43,"hitsDay":21,"hitsWeek":43,"hitsMonth":43,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-24T09:00:33.224Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T06:00:37.866Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":1,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmt70ah4a0p39i9e07ipd67nn","bgmId":516426,"categoryId":null,"name":"一斩苍穹","slug":"video-38557","sub":null,"nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ef/2e/516426_JJUoU.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":null,"actor":null,"writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"仙界至暗，众生皆材；残躯少年谷安，于生死绝境夺得古神之力，携以无限灵气，执凡刃，荡恶人，雪深仇，斩苍穹！","remarks":"更新至第6集","tag":"动画,动作冒险,剧情","area":"中国","lang":"国语","year":2026,"season":null,"total":26,"episodeCount":6,"serial":true,"status":1,"score":0,"scoreCount":0,"hits":64,"hitsDay":36,"hitsWeek":64,"hitsMonth":64,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-24T09:00:49.834Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T05:00:52.749Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":1,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmq2lzkaz7gvui9cp7it7pf8g","bgmId":354700,"categoryId":null,"name":"吉伊卡哇","slug":"video-5054","sub":"小可爱 / Chiikawa","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/c9/b1/354700_S6YP6.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":"三原武宪,北川隆之,佐藤雅子,木村宽","actor":"青木遥,田中诚人,小泽亚李,井口裕香,杉田智和,东地宏树,松冈祯丞,内田雄马,浅井孝行","writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"<p>　　由ナガノ氏在推特上連載的漫畫《吉伊卡哇》，宣布將於2022年推出動畫，作品由動畫工房擔綱製作。《吉伊卡哇》是描述一群可愛小動物們的日常物語，